6. Simulation-only integration and warranty

The Software is an unofficial flight-simulator radio integration.
It modifies supported locally installed aircraft files and connects the
simulator with the user's installed SRS software. Compatibility, radio
synchronization, encryption controls, installation and restoration may
be incomplete, fail, or change with third-party updates.

It is not a certified aircraft system, an operational radio system,
or a tool approved for real-world flight or communications.
Simulator ENC/KEY features provide no assurance of real-world
communications security.

